OL,3,GNEWSAWhat are the Great Scottish Run
OL,4,Aroutes and which roads are closed?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA record number of runners are expected
OL,7,Fto hit the streets of Glasgow this
OL,8,Fweekend as Scotland's biggest running
OL,9,Fevent returns.
OL,11,FOrganisers estimate about 35,000 people
OL,12,Fwill take part in this year's Great
OL,13,FScottish Run, an increase of about
OL,14,F3,000 on the race's previous record.
OL,16,FThis year will also see the return of
OL,17,Fevents for junior runners and toddlers,
OL,18,Fafter fears over Storm Amy last year
OL,19,Fforced them to be cancelled.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
