OL,3,GNEWSAWhat are the Great Scottish Run
OL,4,Aroutes and which roads are closed?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe race, which has raised thousands
OL,7,Ffor charity over the years, dates back
OL,8,Fto 1979 when the first edition was a
OL,9,Fmarathon.
